message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the paper below."
title: "Replication code and data: Big Five Personality Traits and Built Environment Characteristics from Street View Imagery"
abstract: >-
  Replication materials for a study relating ZIP-code-level Big Five personality
  trait scores to built environment characteristics extracted from Google Street
  View imagery across Austin, Dallas, Houston, and San Antonio, Texas, using
  pooled and city-specific OLS and spatial lag models.
